## What the GPL asks of this repository

Because this repository publishes APKs, the obligations are live rather than theoretical:

- The complete corresponding source for every published build is this repository, at the tag the
  build was made from. The release notes of each APK name that tag.
- The notices travel with the binary: the licence text, the copyright headers in the source, and
  the About screen's licence notice.
- No additional restrictions are imposed on the source (GPL §10). There is no "non-commercial
  use only", no "do not fork", no NDA on the code.
- The licence may not be changed to something more restrictive. GPL-3.0-or-later means version 3
